## systemctl command

syntax: ```systemctl <subcommand> <service name>```

restart after every configurations
restart when troubleshooting.

subcommands: status,start ,stop ,restart ,enable , disable

| command | description |
| --- | --- |
| lscpu | List cpu information |
| lshw | List hardware |
| du |  Check file and directory size |
| df | disk size and free space |
| fdisk | List and modify partitions on the hard drive |
| vmstat | Indicate use of virtual memory  |


